Package: gao
Type: Package
Title: A Complete Library of GAO Reports and Metadata
Version: 0.5.0
Authors@R: person(c("Jack", "T."), "Rametta", email = "jtrametta@gmail.com",
                  role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
                  comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-9841-146X"))
Description: A complete library of metadata for reports published by
    the United States Government Accountability Office (GAO), with tools
    for downloading the report files. Ships with a bundled dataset of
    over 55,000 report URLs spanning 1921 to the present, refreshed daily
    via continuous integration and accessible offline. Provides a
    one-step download function that filters by fiscal year and format,
    and a text extraction utility for downloaded PDFs. Browsing the
    bundled metadata and exporting it to CSV work with no system
    dependencies; downloading PDFs or HTML directly from
    <https://www.gao.gov> requires 'curl-impersonate' (see
    SystemRequirements) to handle TLS fingerprint filtering. Not
    affiliated with or endorsed by the U.S. Government Accountability
    Office.
